 "notes": [
  "Qty 59 as published (8 unlabelled opening cards, Locations, Admirals Order, Characters 18, 'Big Blue' 7, 'Green Things' 3, Effects 8, Interrupts 11); 'Big Blue' and 'Green Things' are section headers.",
  "The first eight cards (SYCFA, Death Star, DS DB, Alderaan, Prepared Defenses, Imp. Arrest Order, Mob Points, Combat Response) are listed first without a 'starting' label, so only the Objective is set as the starting card.",
  "Posted 'DS DB' dested Death Star: Docking Bay 327 (the Death Star site for this Set Your Course For Alderaan deck), not Death Star II: Docking Bay; 'Darth Vader (Old School)' dested the Premiere Darth Vader; '4 Lom with rifle' 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Space Port DB' Spaceport Docking Bay.",
  "Posted 'Grabber x2' is left UNKNOWN: no card of that name exists, and Allegations Of Corruption (the later 'grabber') is a Coruscant card released after this February 2001 post.",
  "Posted 'TINT/Oppressive Enforcement' dested There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement; 'Control/ Set For Stun' Control & Set For Stun; Battle Order is the Endor Effect (not the Reflections III shield).",
  "The strategy says Guri is in the deck in place of something like Officer Evax; that change is not applied (dested as posted)."
